      "title": "Indian Renewable Energy Development Agency Limited Recommends Final Dividend of Fiscal Year 2025-26",
      "body": "Indian Renewable Energy Development Agency Limited at its board meeting held on May 29, 2026 recommended final dividend of INR 0.75/- per equity share, i.e., @ 7.50% (subject to deduction of TDS) on the face value of the paid-up equity shares of INR 10/- each for the Fiscal Year 2025-26, subject to the approval of the shareholders at the ensuing Annual General Meeting (AGM) of the Company. The final dividend, if declared, would be paid within 30 days from the date of its declaration at the AGM. The Record Date for Final Dividend would be fixed and intimated in due course. This final dividend is in addition to the Interim Dividend of INR 0.60 per equity share, i.e., @ 6% (subject to deduction of TDS) on the face value of the paid-up equity shares of INR 10/- each, for the Fiscal Year 2025-2",
